t to be tabled in each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that House after the report is given to the Minister.*","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-representatives-8946","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/representatives/2024-06-04/3"}
